sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Auth as routes/auth.py
  participant Service as auth/service.py
  participant Db as chatbot_users
  Browser->>Auth: POST /api/auth/register or login
  Auth->>Service: register or sign_in
  Service->>Db: insert user or select by email
  Service->>Db: insert refresh token hash
  Auth-->>Browser: AuthResponse
  Browser->>Auth: POST /api/auth/refresh
  Auth->>Service: rotate_refresh_token
  Service->>Db: revoke old hash insert new
  Auth-->>Browser: new AuthResponse
